    "text": "These former City of Phoenix area high school standouts will be active on Friday, Nov. 7.\nArman Madi\nNorthern Arizona Lumberjacks\nGuard\nSophomore\n6′6″ 220\nBrophy College Preparatory\nHometown: Paradise Valley\nNext Game: vs. Justice Lions, Friday, Nov. 7, 6 p.m.\nOakland Fort\nNorthern Arizona Lumberjacks\nGuard\nSenior\n5′10″ 180\nSunnyslope High School\nHometown: Phoenix\nNext Game: vs. Justice Lions, Friday, Nov. 7, 6 p.m.",
